The repository is a 30-day Python learning collection: most days have a Markdown lesson with exercises, while Day 1 has a runnable example rather than a lesson file. I’ll document the actual lesson paths and note the available language and data resources without implying the translations are complete.
Created `README.md` in the repository root. It starts with a level-one heading and documents the course outline, lesson links, getting started, and supporting resources. No other files were changed.

